Hunt is an actor and cocreator of <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/apple-tv/">Apple TV</a>'s <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/04/28/apple-tv-ted-lasso-season-four-release-date/"><em>Ted Lasso</em></a>. Lowe hosts NBC Sports' Premier League coverage and is cohosting FOX Sports' FIFA World Cup 2026 broadcast. The two will recap games as the tournament unfolds, with new episodes landing multiple times a week in the hours after notable matches. <br/>
<br/>
The show is produced by <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/apple-news/">Apple News</a> and presented by Verizon, and will be available in audio and video on &zwnj;Apple News&zwnj;, <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/apple-podcasts/">Apple Podcasts</a>, and other podcast platforms. The first episode arrives on June 7 with tournament previews.<br/>
<br/>
